{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ef44590b69155691",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "label": "1. You and your partner"
    },
    {
      "id": "489f1850c8362c9a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "text": "# Phone or PC browser\n\n## React app\n`client/`\n\nLogin, Photo, Text, Browse, History.\nSaved to the home screen like an app.\n\n[[client-app]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "8d7e97030fe7c002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "text": "# Tailscale\n\n## Private network\n\nOnly invited devices can reach the server. Never on the public internet. Gives HTTPS.\n\n[[tailscale-setup]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "62d3672ca1ab8920",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "label": "2. Marketlens server (Python FastAPI, server/)"
    },
    {
      "id": "911d5964d7928984",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "text": "# main.py\n\n## All the routes\n\nChecks every request, then calls the files on the right. Also serves the built React app.\n\n[[server-main]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad14a848dcd47643",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "text": "# auth.py\n\n## Who are you?\n\nAccess code, scrypt hash, signed httpOnly cookie, lockout after 5 wrong tries.\n\n[[server-auth]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "53f68b697777a82a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "text": "# engine.py\n\n## CLIP\n\nPhoto or text to 512 numbers, then the closest stored photos.\n\n[[server-engine]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8094b76b46718d6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "text": "# catalog.py\n\n## Products + price package\n\n1,394 products in memory. Low, median, high.\n\n[[server-catalog]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "fe3ece9c90434a96",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "text": "# history.py\n\n## Saved lookups\n\nMarketlens' own small database. Each person sees only their own.\n\n[[server-history]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "76597405a9cc2d90",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "text": "# tests/\n\n## 7 checks\n\nLogin, safety, a real lookup, privacy. Run with pytest.\n\n[[tests]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2569721f8f449e1",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1960,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "label": "3. Web Scraping data (read-only)"
    },
    {
      "id": "67b69ff5f4ca5c1b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "text": "# 5 site databases\n\n## 1,394 products\n\nNames, brands, types, prices. Opened read-only: Marketlens cannot change them.\n\n[[limits]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "3664ac89905eba35",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#C6FF00",
      "text": "# CLIP index + photos\n\n## 7,428 photos\n\nvectors.npy, index.json and the image files. Photos are private research only.\n\n[[data-flow]]"
    }
  ],
